{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Lan": 24,
    "Player": 6
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2210901",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Lan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "221090101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "221090101": {
            "id": "221090101",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "*sigh* Still nothing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090102"
            ]
          },
          "221090102": {
            "id": "221090102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090103"
            ]
          },
          "221090103": {
            "id": "221090103",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Oh, it's you two again. Clearly there aren't enough guild quests to keep you occupied.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090104"
            ]
          },
          "221090104": {
            "id": "221090104",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "If you are interested, I have another Commission you could take?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090105"
            ]
          },
          "221090105": {
            "id": "221090105",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "A group of Hilichurl Shooters has congregated in the middle of Guili Plains and are threatening passers-by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090106"
            ]
          },
          "221090106": {
            "id": "221090106",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "They may only be hilichurls, but there are a lot of them and they have the higher ground. The average adventurer would be helpless against them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090107"
            ]
          },
          "221090107": {
            "id": "221090107",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "I need you to dispose of them, quickly and efficiently. Afterwards, there will be ample compensation waiting for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090108"
            ]
          },
          "221090108": {
            "id": "221090108",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Also — if you come across anything to do with a sword, anything at all, please bring it back to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090111",
              "221090113"
            ]
          },
          "221090111": {
            "id": "221090111",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "I can't tell whether your eagerness to take this on is born out of youthful naivety or boundless courage...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090112"
            ]
          },
          "221090112": {
            "id": "221090112",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "But if I'm sure about one thing, it's that you truly have an Adventurer's spirit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090115"
            ]
          },
          "221090115": {
            "id": "221090115",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "That's all I have to say. It's time for you to get ready."
          },
          "221090113": {
            "id": "221090113",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Nothing, the two are unrelated. All I need you to do is keep an eye out for it — if you find something, bring it back. If not, it's no problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090114"
            ]
          },
          "221090114": {
            "id": "221090114",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "The objective of this Commission is to defeat the hilichurls. Defeat them, and you will get your reward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2210902",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all opponents",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "221090201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "221090201": {
            "id": "221090201",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Have you defeated the Hilichurl Shooters yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090202"
            ]
          },
          "221090202": {
            "id": "221090202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Not yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090203"
            ]
          },
          "221090203": {
            "id": "221090203",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Is that because you're preparing meticulously, or because you're dragging your heels?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090204"
            ]
          },
          "221090204": {
            "id": "221090204",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "...Or is it a little from column A, a little from column B?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2210903",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Lan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "221090301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "221090301": {
            "id": "221090301",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Have you defeated the Hilichurl Shooters yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090302"
            ]
          },
          "221090302": {
            "id": "221090302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090303"
            ]
          },
          "221090303": {
            "id": "221090303",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Good job. I hope they didn't give you too much trouble? No, I didn't think they would... just asking to be polite.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090304"
            ]
          },
          "221090304": {
            "id": "221090304",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Still nothing on the sword? *sigh* Surprise, surprise... a futile search once again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090305"
            ]
          },
          "221090305": {
            "id": "221090305",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Thank you, anyway. Here is your compensation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090306"
            ]
          },
          "221090306": {
            "id": "221090306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why are you preoccupied with this sword?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090307"
            ]
          },
          "221090307": {
            "id": "221090307",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "...I suppose there's no harm in telling you. Its name is Unseen Razor. My older brother was its proud owner.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090308"
            ]
          },
          "221090308": {
            "id": "221090308",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "But inexplicably, it was not found on his person when he passed away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090309"
            ]
          },
          "221090309": {
            "id": "221090309",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "He always had that sword with him. Always. So for something to happen that separated him from it... It's bothered me ever since.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090310"
            ]
          },
          "221090310": {
            "id": "221090310",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Unfortunately, I've never found a single solid lead on where the sword might be, or what he encountered before he died.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "221090311"
            ]
          },
          "221090311": {
            "id": "221090311",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "That's it, really. There's nothing more to say. Except have a nice day."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}